        <p>‘Varrington Market Prices. At Wednesday's Warrington Market the price of wheat ruled at 7s. 9d. to Bs. per 701 b., and 4s. 9d. was realised for oats. Flour realised 465. to 51s. per 2801 b., 2s. 2d. to 2s. lid. being the price of thirds. The price of bran and other offals was is. 6d. to is. 9d.</p>
